<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><br><br></font><p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><br><br></font><p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><br></font><p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><b><font size="2">RE: {!Case.Baggage_File_Reference__c}</font></b></p><font size="2" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><br></font><p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font size="2">Thanks for your patience while we assessed your damaged bag.</font></p><font size="2" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><br></font><p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><b><i><font size="2">-If&nbsp;pictures unclear use:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><br></font><p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font size="2">I regret we are unable to determine the damage to your baggage from the photos provided. Please send us <b><i>-advise what is required-</i></b> by replying to this email.</font></p><font size="2" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><br></font><p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><b><i><font size="2">-If requesting receipts use:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><br></font><p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font size="2">To assist us in reviewing your claim, we will require:</font></p><p style=""><font size="2" style="" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Baggage&nbsp;receipts given to you at check in;</font></p><p style=""></p><ul style=""><li style="text-align: left;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Proof of purchase (if you are providing receipts as proof of purchase then original receipts must be provided.)</font></li><li style="text-align: left;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Pictures of damage to bag</font></li><li style="text-align: left;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2">Brand of bag, age of bag, original cost of bag.</font></li></ul><p style=""></p><div style=""><p style=""></p><p style=""><font size="2" style="" face="Arial, sans-serif">Please send this through to us by replying to this email.</font></p></div><font size="2" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><br></font><p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font size="2">As always, our Baggage Services team is available on 1300 306 980, should you wish to call us.</font></p><font size="2" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><br></font><p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font size="2">Once again, on behalf of the team at Qantas, we apologise for the inconvenience experienced but look forward to resolving this for you as soon as possible.&nbsp;</font></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font size="2"><br></font></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font size="2"><br></font></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><br></font><p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><br></font><p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><br></font><p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font size="2"><br></font></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font size="2"><br></font></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; text-align: center;"><span style="color: white; font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</font></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>